  "notes": "受限网络下连接更稳。\n\n- 登录、账户、签到及入口名单请求也能使用备用安全 DNS，减少入口可用但页面加载失败的情况。\n- 某个地址无法连接时，会及时尝试同一可信域名的其他 IPv4 或 IPv6 地址。\n- 改善代理连接失败后的恢复，保留请求取消、证书验证及防止重复提交的保护。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable connections on restricted networks.\n\n- Sign-in, account, check-in, and trusted endpoint list requests can now use backup secure DNS, reducing cases where an endpoint is reachable but a page fails to load.\n- When one address cannot connect, YueLink promptly tries other IPv4 or IPv6 addresses for the same trusted domain.\n- Recovery from proxy connection failures is more reliable, while preserving cancellation, certificate verification, and protection against duplicate submissions.\n",
